/ModDate (D:20211227190300+00'00')
/Subject (Based on the principle that perfection is a divine criterion, process management exists on the one hand to achieve excellence \(near perfection\) and on the other hand to avoid imperfection. In other words, Operational Excellence \(EO\) is one of the approaches, when used rigorously, aims to maximize performance. Therefore, the mastery of problem solving remains necessary to achieve such performance level.)
/CreationDate (D:20211227190300+00'00')
/Author (Mohammed Hamoumi1 , Abdellah Haddout2 and Mariam Benhadou2)
